test.t1	analyze	status	OK
test.t2	analyze	status	OK
test.t3	analyze	status	OK
EXPLAIN format=tree SELECT outr.col_int_nokey FROM t2 as outr STRAIGHT_JOIN t3 AS outr2
ON outr2.col_time_key > outr.col_datetime_key 
WHERE outr.col_int_nokey 
IN ( SELECT col_int_key FROM t1 AS innr WHERE innr.pk >= innr.col_int_nokey ) 
AND ( outr.col_int_nokey <= 6 OR outr.col_varchar_key IS NULL );
EXPLAIN
-> Gather: 2 workers, parallel scan on outr, outr2  (...)
    -> Filter: (cast(outr2.col_time_key as datetime) > outr.col_datetime_key)  (...)
        -> Inner hash join, hash table shared by worker threads (no condition)  (...)
            -> Parallel index scan on outr2 using col_time_key  (...)
            -> Hash
                -> Nested loop semijoin  (...)
                    -> Filter: (outr.col_int_nokey <= 6)  (...)
                        -> Parallel table scan on outr  (...)
                    -> Filter: (innr.pk >= innr.col_int_nokey)  (...)
                        -> Index lookup on innr using col_int_key (col_int_key=outr.col_int_nokey)  (...)

Warnings:
Warning	1739	Cannot use range access on index 'col_time_key' due to type or collation conversion on field 'col_time_key'
drop table t1,t2,t3;
